WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.990
This step is high winds only.

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:08.920
If you have not been told to evacuate, take refuge in a designated storm shelter or an interior room.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.694
If officials told you to leave, that order comes first.

00:00:12.694 --> 00:00:15.096
This is not the flood-water action.
